OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor arrested over
OL,4,Aelection papers
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridgeshire Police said: "A
OL,7,F42-year-old man from Waterbeach was
OL,8,Farrested on 24 September on suspicion
OL,9,Fof making false statements in
OL,10,Fnomination papers. He has since been
OL,11,Freleased on bail to return to Milton
OL,12,FPolice Station on 22 December."
OL,14,FCoogan told the BBC he had "always been
OL,15,Fand will continue to be happy to help
OL,16,Fpolice with their inquiries".
